+        // De-Googled build: the spare slot opens an incognito tab.
+        //
+        // It previously held Ask Gemini, removed in an earlier patch, which left the bottom bar
+        // with four buttons and the layout unbalanced. Incognito is a useful destination that
+        // needs no account, and it restores the original five-button arrangement with the new tab
